1
00:00:00,146 --> 00:00:01,316
(Raj:)Why?

2
00:00:01,313 --> 00:00:04,153
(Howard:)Well, because I've known you
for ten years

3
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:05,820
(Howard:)and you've never gone to temple,

4
00:00:05,818 --> 00:00:07,648
(Howard:)you never talked
about believing in God,

5
00:00:07,653 --> 00:00:11,953
(Howard:)and last Diwali I watched you
eat two pounds of sacred cow

6
00:00:11,957 --> 00:00:15,197
(Howard:)at a Brazilian steak house.

7
00:00:15,194 --> 00:00:17,964
(Raj:)Religion is
a very personal thing.

8
00:00:17,963 --> 00:00:20,463
(Raj:)I do go to temple--
I just... I don't talk about it.

9
00:00:20,466 --> 00:00:22,136
(Howard:)Yeah, but you're
a scientist.

10
00:00:22,134 --> 00:00:23,304
(Raj:)So?

11
00:00:23,302 --> 00:00:24,972
(Howard:)So, as a scientist,
you believe the way

12
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:26,640
(Howard:)to understand the universe
is through facts and evidence,

13
00:00:26,639 --> 00:00:27,669
(Howard:)and now
you're counting

14
00:00:27,673 --> 00:00:29,303
(Howard:)on some blue chick

15
00:00:29,308 --> 00:00:31,638
(Howard:)with a hundred arms to help you?

16
00:00:31,644 --> 00:00:34,144
(Raj:)That is so offensive.
Does everything you know

17
00:00:34,146 --> 00:00:35,646
(Raj:)about Hinduism come
from Indiana Jones?

18
00:00:35,648 --> 00:00:38,918
(Howard:)No. There's also Apu
from The Simpsons.

19
00:00:39,985 --> 00:00:43,525
(Raj:)Well, lots of scientists
believe in God.

20
00:00:43,522 --> 00:00:46,222
(Raj:)Okay? Newton,
uh, Faraday,

21
00:00:46,225 --> 00:00:48,155
(Raj:)uh, Pascal-- all were believers.

22
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:50,990
(Raj:)Even Einstein was famous
for attacking quantum theory

23
00:00:50,996 --> 00:00:53,366
(Raj:)on the grounds
that "God does not play dice

24
00:00:53,365 --> 00:00:54,535
with the universe."
Well, of course

25
00:00:54,533 --> 00:00:58,233
(Howard:)he believed in God--
he slept with Marilyn Monroe.

26
00:00:58,237 --> 00:01:00,337
(Amy:)Actually
there's no proof of that.

